  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80e7a662bb0d7b6311f9a45e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "准备参加“日本C”的待兼诗歌剧\n干劲十足，状态也非常好。社会大众也\n很期待她的精彩表现！然而到了当天──",
      "source_fingerprint": "118579f4f3633c43b915d08ee52d52261e2c045a7090c1b1d5779d788624a876",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aac1786a75b3d4ad81dd8a9d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我却接到她流鼻血昏倒，\n被送往医院的通知。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4391f0b78f8fee45ae352285caae8743131c5f9272a770362ebcb1439334dbeb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a0d401fb2c2bb889b0c1d1c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然情况不严重，但医生诊断的结果指出她\n无法参加今天的比赛。尽管她一开始故作坚强，\n却还是缓缓流下不甘心的泪水。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f882be69cc3f332575d8531fcf486f55871dc8f99cedadb0d6592296db3c2ce3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb9b397d0fe6d05f86bb7ea3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此时……她的朋友们前来鼓励她。\n告诉错失“主角”机会的她\n要保持乐观，还有下次机会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06226a14e82efad7268a0cab853d9a10758cd7e6e0c6f91dc0b6de203d76f7ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e024ab3a50d200a70e21441",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们说的都是至今为止，待兼诗歌剧好几次\n带给他人勇气的话语。重新振作起来的她\n决定下次一定要赢下“有马纪念”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "322573e5ac1c39aa0553d48c45e237c5a5f4e0a5b9151cecdd733c5cff2a3eb4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07f1d6f062135c61bb9d3feb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跌倒、回归、期待已久",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0fe8078c66079ed86e136a50975bcdee1902ff942dab548802031aa2e19f60c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba4b563043e7aca6569af42d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3e1be947540b20dd3241257",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "时间来到了夏季集训！\n有些学生绷紧神经面对\n这段最适合提升体能的训练期间──",
      "source_fingerprint": "47a44fc35dcf739d6bf903faa491ec2b8473a42050bf130b9fdea7b180b9bb43",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:693a9af76ae2f14d11b7648a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
