    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4e74b5d5be291f9fa8fab9c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第三年的夏季集训开始了！\n有些赛马娘显得稍微紧张，\n但她还是一样气定神闲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22e72ec42fc1fe7c4501ec54e7d55cccb48e6e3acb37847bf58fa135bbdff59b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
