    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca4f1ea254478c37f6877ee9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼诗歌剧做好了万全准备！\n虽然她在干劲十足地来到赛场后\n还是犯了不小心走错休息室的粗心错误──",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ac08c6cd6a77d4be5959ebb7712468ab4578335adaebc550e0fa0fa40c80963",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:994cc049ec0593ff47680caf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f55fba4215f4a5fec3a74774",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但出道战依然顺利揭开了序幕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a65e6443339155374a4e24339e5868ecff597d72bb2d9df0fdcd726c3130b817",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6c94084d20c9633015a6ff6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向出道战",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea754365577b70c3247fb413fa7b90388e1e4a185a1da5f6c50ef25fe13c496",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2149dd9b7d09d17a09699a8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典三冠路线“皋月赏”当天。\n许多观众都万分期待\n接下来即将展开的激战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0297daf54edf59714a1db0bcac3b621ea39683d6001052f4bb094073c9ee3477",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0984ed8d77707836d38bc594",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同时，干劲十足的美浦波旁也走在\n地下道的路上。米浴相当崇拜美浦波旁，\n也很想在赛场上追过她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bc5463e8d4d8665b7ab7a68672273cbcd65a9ae665e14a86f087d43102589aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea4969480357d4524ffdd122",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而待兼诗歌剧则在一旁观察着两人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06ce73b3bc64e7dc5484b628d1ddfd6988788d8baaa6468012d3fb7541c61393",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4cb9eda9f387a816b538e37",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看她理所当然地站在地下道边缘的模样，\n心里有种说不上的感觉……\n总之，“皋月赏”就此揭开序幕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b70f0f1b6f764eb982a01caa0dc42af413cb4a04a866b90554fff4a4d3f407f3",
